flowchart TB
  installer[Install bin links] --> registrar[Scheduler selects wire / default v4]
  setup[OS setup and daily updater explicitly select v9] --> runner[Wire runner entry]
  registrar --> runner
  runner --> config[File config and platform identity / normal OFF skips]
  config --> v1[Legacy v1 / directory lock and PID]
  config --> older[v2 and v4 / nonce contender lock / post gate]
  config --> current[v5 to v9 / shared main selected by basename]
  older --> owners[Publish owner hardlink / reject legacy unknown or live owner]
  current --> owners
  owners --> task[Scan or reuse report ID / enqueue / flush]
  v1 --> task
  task -- child failed --> retain[Exit nonzero / partial report ACK and queue retained]
  task -- v7 to v9 successful finalize flush --> receipt[Batch-bound delivery receipt / separate from UI]
  task --> release[Finally release own lock / directory or nonce by wire]
  retain --> release
  receipt --> release
  installer --> oracle[Explicit Oracle compatibility / exec Node and Chrome]
  installer --> sweep[Explicit sync sweep / repo fetch and stdout table]
  installer --> overlay[Explicit Community relay / desktop then AFK]
  overlay --> product[Product-owned update script / push only when requested]
